<title>USA: Appliance Recycling gets higher credit.</title>
<headline>Appliance Recycling gets higher credit.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Appliance Recycling Centers of America Inc said Thursday it secured a $1.5 million revolving line of credit, replacing its previous line of $400,000.</p>
<p>It said the line of credit will be used to support its national reconditioned appliance business operating through the company's growing Encore retail network.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
